# Knowledge

The knowledge layer turns external sources into durable, inspectable context without pretending saved sources are true or endorsed.

- Raw sources stay authoritative and immutable when feasible.
- Source cards are compact provenance records, not endorsements.
- Compiled pages synthesize reusable patterns, comparisons, playbooks, questions, and decision rules.
- Internal personal context belongs in domain notes under `vault/`, not external source-card domains.
